ickets.express/universum-city-karlsruhe/booking/15239","showingTagIds":null,"isPremiere":false,"isPreview":false,"protectedColumns":["highlightAfterDatetime","highlightText"],"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.cineamo.com/showings/46387432"}},"_embedded":{"content":{"id":2043666,"name":"48/49 - Revolution in Baden.","slug":"48-49-revolution-in-baden","category":"movie_series","description":"In September 1847, the people gathered at the “Salmen” inn in Offenburg and put forward 13 demands: freedom of the press, trial by jury, fair taxation and a parliament representing the people. What began as a protest became the revolution in Baden. In April 1848, Friedrich Hecker set out from Konstanz with a volunteer militia, in September Gustav Struve proclaimed the republic in Lörrach, and in May 1849 the Baden army went over to the people. Grand Duke Leopold fled and a provisional government took control of the country. Only Prussian troops brought the Baden Revolution to an end: on 23 July 1849, the fortress of Rastatt surrendered.","descriptionEn":null,"isOwnContent":null,"duration":null,"creatorCinemaId":null,"posterImageRef":null,"posterImageUrl":null,"backdropImageRef":null,"backdropImageUrl":null,"ageRating":null,"trailerUrl":null,"isRegularEvent":false,"hasMarketingAssistantBooked":false,"futureShowingsCount":19,"premiereDate":"2026-10-16T00:00:00Z","cineamoMovie":null,"movieId":1421485,"metrics":null,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.cineamo.com/contents/2043666"}}},"cinema":{"id":104,"name":"Universum City Kinos Karlsruhe","shortName":"Universum City Kinos","slug":"universum-city-kinos-karlsruhe","description":"Das Universum-Kino ist ein traditionelles Innenstadt-Kino mit zentraler Lage am Europaplatz. Vor nicht zu langer Zeit wurde es renoviert und die 5 Säle mit neuer Bestuhlung ausgestattet. Als einzigstes Kino in Karlsruhe und Umgebung bietet das Universum City im Universum 1 und im Universum 5 das D-BOX MOTION Erlebnis. D-Box Motion Seats bieten ein inten